; Check a card by the fingerprint read back by voice.
FORM CARD_CHECK
TITLE Check a card by voice
SUMMARY Marks a card checked when the fingerprint the station reads to you matches. Only checked cards get sealed frequencies and keys.
LEVEL ZERO
ORDER 22
ACTION card_check
FIELD station Station(@cards_unchecked) required
FIELD fingerprint Fingerprint read to you(X) required upper check=fingerprint
FIELD keymaster Also accept them as your keymaster(Y,N) default=N
NEXT KEYMASTER BUNDLE_SEND
BEGIN_HELP
Fingerprint read to you:
Four groups of four, as the other operator reads them off their screen. Spaces don't matter.
END

Also accept them as your keymaster:
Your choice alone: whose key tapes this box takes. Say Y only for the station whose authority you accept.
END
